<title>HONG KONG: Trading in Yaohan Food shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Yaohan Food shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Yaohan Food Processing &amp; Trading Co Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong Stock Exchange said on Monday.</p>
</text>
